# Project Rules: How To Live Better

## 1. Non-Negotiables
- **English only:** Zero CJK characters in anything shipped (`dist/`, slugs, OG image, JSON-LD, console).
- **Faithful translation:** Never summarize, omit, add, or alter numbers, percentages, units, dates, DOIs, URLs, citations, or RMB (¥).
- **Licence (CC BY 4.0):** Attribution to eternity4719 on every page footer, link to original repo and license, plus mainland China disclaimers.
- **Privacy:** No analytics, no cookies, no third-party requests; self-host all fonts; state in `localStorage` only.
- **Source untouched:** Read-only submodule `./source`.
- **Character discipline:** Plus & Minus never comment on, rate, or joke about tips. Calm mode on sensitive chapters.

## 2. Acceptance Criteria
- 765 tips total; exact evidence grades and value tier counts match.
- Zero CJK in output; all cross-references resolve.
- Lighthouse $\ge 90$ performance, $\ge 95$ a11y, best practices, SEO.
- Reader JS budget $\le 60\text{ KB}$ gzip; character SVG $\le 25\text{ KB}$; comic font $\le 25\text{ KB}$.
- Playwright E2E passing on 360px mobile viewports with no overflow.

## 3. Don'ts
- Don't improve advice or invent statistics/hotlines.
- Don't use external chart libraries or raster character art.
- Don't put characters, halftone, or ink outlines inside the reading column.
- Don't animate body text or hijack native scrolling.
- Don't stop to ask unless fully blocked.
